Description:

cyr_virusscan has a new -S/--since option, to only scan messages saved to
their mailbox within the given duration (for example 36h or 2d).  A periodic
job no longer has to rescan every message on every run, holding each mailbox
locked while it does.


Documentation:

docsrc/reference/manpages/systemcommands/cyr_virusscan.rst


Config changes:

None.


Upgrade instructions:

None.  To make an existing periodic cyr_virusscan job incremental, pass
-S with a duration slightly longer than the job's interval.


